DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       uuttmmppdduummpp is a simple program to dump UTMP and WTMP files in raw format,
       so they can be examined. uuttmmppdduummpp reads from stdin unless a _f_i_l_e_n_a_m_e is
       passed.

OOPPTTIIOONNSS
       --ff, ----ffoollllooww
           Output appended data as the file grows.

       --oo, ----oouuttppuutt _f_i_l_e
           Write command output to _f_i_l_e instead of standard output.

       --rr, ----rreevveerrssee
           Undump, write back edited login information into the utmp or wtmp
           files.

       --hh, ----hheellpp
